    "leader_template": "3k_main_template_historical_han_sui_hero_metal",
    "subtitle": "Tireless Insurgent",
    "description": "The Liang Rebellion may have burned out to an ember, but Han Sui's ambitious heart burns as brightly as ever. He may have \"surrendered\" to the Han court, but this was always meant to be a temporary reprieve, or at worst, a set back. For now, the wily snake licks his wounds, and waits. For now, Ma Teng is a useful friend to have, but if he is to get in the way of Han Sui's grand plans, he will soon be discarded. The local lords of the western regions and weak and divided, and Han Sui bides his time until the inevitable day comes when the sparks of rebellion reignite. With the Han court under the grasp of a tyrant, and the east divided into bickering warlords, that day may come sooner than Han Sui ever expected...",
