    "subtitle": "Prosperous Trader",
    "description": "There are few both within and without the Empire who have not heard tales of the magnanimity and beneficence of Liu Yu. As a proud and loyal member of the Imperial clan, Liu Yu uses every resource and scrap of influence he can for charitable means. Steel is forged into plows and tools rather than swords and armour, and alms are given both to the commonfolk under his rule, and the foreigners living across his northern border. With kindness and clever rhetoric, a speech alone from his lips can prevent a war. However, it would be foolish to dismiss Liu Yu's benign compassion for weakness. Should warlords refuse to listen to reason or rebels seek to exploit his charity, they will find his blade just as tempered as any other.",
