    "leader_template": "3k_main_template_historical_gongsun_du_hero_metal",
    "subtitle": "the Warlike",
    "description": "Gongsun Du's youth was spent in absolute poverty, in unimaginably harsh conditions on the northern frontier. With nothing to speak of to his name, with no famous or wealthy relative to support him, everything he has ever gained or accomplished, he has earned through hard and often ruthless grit. Now, with the land in turmoil, opportunity finally arises for this self-taught warlord. The Han's control over the eastern fringes and southeastern peninsula is slipping away to local clans, and only a strong and stone-hearted warrior with knowledge of the area can hope to tame it. Recommended by one of the generals of Dong Zhuo himself, Gongsun Du finally obtains a right to raise an army. Beyond the Liao river comes a chance of independence from the meek and incompetent bureaucrats of the Han, an opportunity to carve out a world where the strong survive and thrive. With an unrelenting iron fist, he seeks to smash those who dare stand in the way of his ambitious march.",
