                "description": "You have become famed for safeguarding the security of the Han and expanding the borders of the Empire. Once desolate and isolated frontier towns are now bustling trade cities and centers of commerce. Scholars and refugees alike flock to your lands, seeking protection and opportunity. However, even as distant dignitaries praise your deeds and and name, few know of the amount of blood on your hands, and the pile of bones crushed under your feet.",
