                "key": "ironic_liaodong_korea_relations_resource_level_2",
                "title": "Foreign Affairs: Canny Diplomat",
                "description": "War can make strange bedfellows, but in trying times, an enemy's enemy can be a keen ally. You have opened your gates and markets to foreign tribes, and information, goods and culture are freely exchanged. Far off ministers and officials may click their tongues in disgust, but why should a tiger pay heed to the clucks of chickens?",
