                "key": "ironic_liaodong_korea_relations_resource_level_3",
                "title": "Foreign Affairs: Scourge of the Han",
                "description": "You will carve out your own destiny, and your own path, with your own hands. The barbarians have taught you much, and their ways of war are effective in their brutality. Those nobles who looked down on you, the scholars who mocked you, the warlords who dismissed your relevance - all of them will be brought to heel. Those myriad bandits and tribesmen, once so divided, are now under a single banner - yours. The time is approaching.",
