    "subtitle": "Flowing Calligrapher",
    "description": "Being able to navigate through the intricate web of alliances between the gentry and noble clans is an important skill for a scholarly gentleman. Zhang Chao accomplishes this with aplomb, weaving friendships like a poet composes rhapsodies. Although stationed further east than any of his fellow coalition partners, he is no less committed to hunting the despotic Dong Zhuo and bringing a swift end to his reign of tyranny. To do so, Zhang Chao must make a firm moral stance, and if need be, move to secure the Central Plains himself to wrest them away from rebels and traitors. By bringing control back in the hands of respectable, upstanding scholars from excelling clans, Zhang Chao seeks to restore the world to an era of harmony and tranquility.",
