    "leader_template": "3k_main_template_historical_zhang_lu_hero_wood",
    "subtitle": "Celestial Master",
    "description": "The Celestial Master Zhang Lu justly rules his people both as a religious leader and governor. His teachings preach equity, charity and fairness, which extends to his ever prosperous administration. As Zhang Lu builds roads and shares the wealth of his state to all its denizens, the Han court dismisses him as a cult leader and rebel. His unique brand of Daoist teachings are considered unorthodox and dangerous by more traditional scholars, and there are voices in the Imperial court that plea for his \"rebellion\" to be put down. From his well protected position in Hanzhong, Zhang Lu is well poised to spread his beliefs across the west, especially if he can escape the shackles of vassalage and free himself from the bonds imposed by Liu Yan. The people have suffered greatly under the decadent rule of the Han, and the time is now for Zhang Lu to show them a new way, a new path, towards prosperity...",
