    "leader_template": "3k_main_template_historical_yang_feng_hero_wood",
    "subtitle": "White Wave Warlord",
    "description": "In the aftermath of the Yellow Turban Rebellion, disorder still remained in more remote and rural corners of the Empire. Refugees, former rebels, mutinous soldiers and bandits wander the land, often tarred with the same brush. Among them, a handful rise to notoriety, their names hushed in whispers around campfires and garrisons, their reputation feared by merchant caravans and local gentry. Yang Feng is one of these men. He has raised a band of miscreants from the White Wave Valley, bringing a myriad and diverse crew together under his leadership. Both a bandit and mercenary at heart, Yang Feng smells the whiff of opportunity on the air. His allegiances are as flexible as his morals, as he leads his White Wave Bandits out of the Hedong valleys. No cause is beyond reproach, provided the rewards and pay are fitting!",
