    "leader_template": "3k_main_template_historical_wu_jing_hero_fire",
    "subtitle": "Fraternal Noble",
    "description": "Wu Jing is the current head of the dynamic Wu clan of Wu county. His family are known for their fierce independent spirit as well as their wealth and influence over the Jiangdong region. Marriage and old deals have connected the Wu to many of the other local powers and families in the region. Following the news of the turmoil erupting first in the Imperial capital and then throughout the Central Plains, Wu Jing senses a chance. A man who has always put the needs of his clan and kin first, he realises that aggressive action is needed to safeguard his family and home. He sees his beloved Jiangdong region in the hands of unworthy bureaucrats, simpering sycophants, mountain bandits and rebels alike, and he comes the conclusion he has to take action himself. Taking up his sword, and calling in favours from other powerful local nobles such as the Xu and Zhu clans, Wu Jing prepares to make his stand. For, above everything else, family.",
    "difficulty": {
      "text": "Hard",
      "level": "hard"
    },
