    "leader_template": "3k_main_template_historical_ying_shao_hero_fire",
    "subtitle": "Compiler of Almanacs",
    "description": "With calligraphy pen in hand, Ying Shao dutifully scribes the happenings of the world about him, even as it enters such a dark age. Knowing full well the benefit of learning from the classics of the past, he hopes his own recordings will be able to teach and lecture future generations, passing down his own acquired knowledge for generations. With the carnage engulfing the world ever increasing, however, the historian and writer finds himself as a warlord in his own right, at the forefront of the spreading miasma of chaos. Will Ying Shao rise up to become a leader figure in the narrative of this uncertain era, or is he doomed to be left as a minor footnote in the margins of history?",
