    "leader_template": "3k_dlc04_template_historical_liu_xun_fire",
    "subtitle": "Trusting Warlord",
    "description": "With the pressures of the age hemming him in from all directions, Liu Xun finds himself in a quandary. On one side are his duties to the Imperial court, and his official position as a ranked bureaucrat. On the other are many old friends and kin, rising up in arms against the tyrant, and forging out their own domains and factions. Of his old comrades, the likes of Yuan Shu and Cao Cao are particularly ambitious. A challenge crossroads lies before him. Should Liu Xun ignore the call to arms spreading throughout China and manage his territory like a loyal subject of the court, or should he instead follow the lead of his contemporaries and carve out his own independence? If this latter option is taken, a perhaps even more crucial decision has to be made - which of these old friends are to be made allies, and which are destined to be met as foes on the field of war? As time slips away, Liu Xun increasingly needs to weigh up his choices...",
