    "leader_template": "3k_main_template_historical_ze_rong_hero_fire",
    "subtitle": "Populist Rogue",
    "description": "A budding new religion is slowly spreading across the Han Empire from the west, and one of its earliest preachers is Ze Rong. Many devout followers, worshippers of the Great Buddha, have followed Ze Rong en masse. He now shelters as a commander under Tao Qian, who has granted him and his flock a safe haven to practice their worship. Being the leader of a nascent new religious order, however, is not an easy task, and requires influence, supplies, and funding. A lot of funding. To this end, Ze Rong seeks to spread the teachings of the Great Buddha far across the south and the east. If he happens to get incredibly wealthy and powerful along the way, it's all in the name of increasing the reach of his religious cause! That, and ensuring he can live a life of comfort and luxury...",
