    "subtitle": "Pirate of the Bells",
    "description": "Accompanied by the ominous ringing of bells, and with a swoosh of silken sails, Gan Ning and his men arrive with a flourish! Gan Ning leads his brave band of vigilantes to both shores of the river, seeking out corrupt officials and their illgotten gains. Derided as a pirate by many, Gan Ning truly seeks one thing - freedom. Even with a scholar's blood in his veins, he cannot accept a life of mediocrity and the mundane. If no one will recognize his talents, he will find a way for his name to be known - with pillaging, plundering and piracy! For those who seek adventure on the Great River and the freedom of the wind on their backs, seek out Gan Ning. For those lords who instead mistreat the talented and promote the wicked, learn to fear the ringing of the bells!",
