    "mode": "standard",
    "leader_template": "ironic_template_historical_zu_lang_hero_wood",
    "subtitle": "Shanyue Renegade",
    "description": "Freedom must be earned, and independence must be won. Zu Lang has strived for years to carve out a piece of harmony for his people, granting them the liberty to enjoy their lifestyles and cultures away from Han rule. Now, with the northern courts in turmoil and the lords of the land drawing steel against each other, Zu Lang realises that it is time for him to truly rise up. The Shanyue of the south shall take up arms against their oppressors, and never again be subjects of some distant Emperor of the north! For the freedom and liberty of his people, Zu Lang shall fight until his final breath!",
