    "leader_template": "3k_main_template_historical_jia_long_hero_metal",
    "subtitle": "Short-sighted Peacekeeper",
    "description": "For countless centuries, Bashu has been a veritable cradle of resources, farmland and wealth, nestled safely between the mountains and rivers. This hallowed land of plenty has been envied by many, and also fiercely protected by the local gentry and clans. Jia Long stands proudly as a current leader of the local loyalists of Bashu, and grimly peers out at the greedy cretins seeking to exploit his beloved home for their own means. Yellow Turbans, Taolist cultists, barbaric jungle tribes, even an upstart young pirate - Jia Long recognizes these ravenous criminals for what they are. An even bigger affront to the stalwart Jia Long is the recently arrived \"Governor\" Liu Yan, who is in his eyes a two-faced villain who is slowly displacing the local elites with his own eastern cronies. Against such insurmountable threats, Jia Long bravely displays his defiance. He will not rest until he reunites his beloved home, and makes Bashu great once again!",
