    "leader_template": "ironic_template_historical_kuitou_hero_metal",
    "subtitle": "The Regent Chief",
    "description": "With the sudden death of the great Tanshihuai, the Xianbei confederation splintered and shattered as quickly as it was founded. With his sons too dying in swift succession, the legacy of Tanshihuai falls to his young grandsons. Kuitou struggles to wrest control of the bickering Xianbei clans, with many splitting off and scattering across the steppes, refusing to recognise the command of such a young and untested warrior. Of those left, he has to vie with his ambitious and dynamic younger brothers for power, as well as other voices of dissent in what remains of the alliance of clans. There are even those who declare that his youthful cousin Qianman is the rightful successor to Tanshihuai's legacy. If Kuitou is to attempt to make his own mark in the world, never mind surpass his famed grandfather, he must secure his own succession and position as leader of all the Xianbei, by proving himself as a man above all others.",
