    "subtitle": "Criminal Mastermind",
    "description": "An unashamed and self-admitting brigand, You Tu controls his band of outlaws with a tight fist. With intimidation and threats of force, he has overawed other regional hill tribes and gangs into submitting to his own. Merchants and traders fear travelling through the hills and forests You Tu has carved out for his own dominion, and even villages and outposts nestled along the coast have not escaped from his raids. Now, You Tu seeks a far greater prize than merely looting some distant hamlets or mugging passing tradesmen. He senses that the great rule of the Han, centuries old, is weakening fast. Their southern garrisons are undermanned and poorly maintained, their leaders disillusioned and disunited. Seeing a chance for profits and power alike, You Tu leads his mob of bandits not to plunder, but to war and conquest!",
